{
  "_comment": [
    "Paste these entries into LLaMA-Factory's own data/dataset_info.json, then",
    "reference the key from a training config's `dataset:` field.",
    "",
    "`fim_midtrain` is the corpus used for the main results: the 80/15/5",
    "single/pair/triple mixture produced by data_construction/mixing/.",
    "The three unmixed splits below are what data_construction emits directly;",
    "list them comma-separated (dataset: fim_single,fim_pairs,fim_triples) if",
    "you want LLaMA-Factory to concatenate them instead of pre-mixing.",
    "",
    "`file_name` is resolved relative to LLaMA-Factory's dataset_dir."
  ],

  "fim_midtrain": {
    "file_name": "fim_midtrain_mixed.jsonl",
    "formatting": "sharegpt",
